The integer DCT implementation in lib/pure_jpeg/dct.rb is adapted from the
Independent JPEG Group's jfdctint.c and jidctint.c. Its upstream copyright,
disclaimer, and distribution terms are included in LICENSE-IJG. PureJPEG's
adaptation ports the transforms to Ruby arrays, removes the C integration
and scaled-output variants, and normalizes forward coefficients before
quantization. The IJG-derived portions remain subject to those terms.
